class_name TTPixelFont
extends RefCounted

# Code-drawn chunky bitmap pixel font (LEVEL_SCHEMA.md v3: ALL in-game
# text in a code-drawn pixel font with ORIGINAL glyphs, no binary
# assets). 5x7 grid per glyph, 1px tracking. Glyphs are hand-designed
# here (not copied from any font file): each row is a 5-char string,
# '1' = filled pixel, '0' = empty. Unknown chars render blank (never
# crash).
#
# Charset: A-Z, a-z, 0-9, space, '>' ':' '-' '!' '.' "'" '/' ',' '?'
# '+' '(' ')' '=' '%' '&' '_' '#'. Glyph inventory (every string the
# game draws) + coverage check: see verification/glyph-coverage-r4.py.

